stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Reading
  Reading --> Ready: sources read
  Reading --> Unavailable: source fails
  Ready --> Ready: continue after audit or unrelated write
  Ready --> Stale: supported source content changes
  Ready --> Refused: actor or deal changes
  Stale --> Reading: refresh
  Unavailable --> Reading: retry
  Refused --> Reading: authorized fresh read
  %% never Ready -> Unavailable: failed source is labeled complete
